{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"Cairn nods as he goes for the decanter to pour himself a drink.","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:42:04.583000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868276815351930900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"A long time ago my father was killed in an \"Accident\" and my siblings and I vowed to make it know the truth about it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:42:21.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868276885166120972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"I see, then it was murder?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:43:48.840000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868277252637470800","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"She gets up and paces around \"We snuck to where the accident happened to get the evidence we needed. But there was a storm and some men were there.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:44:36.647000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868277453154562119","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"What was the 'accident'?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:45:23.504000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868277649687052289","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"Cairn listens intently.","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:46:12.890000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868277856826953768","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
