{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"When I woke I was in so much pain. I had been hit by lightning. I hurt all over but I felt so strong. That's when I knew I wasn't myself anymore. I knew I had to use what I was given to stop the men from hurting anyone else.\" Her arms fall and \"But Mam said I had to run.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:58:29.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868280946024136734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
